<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post5499045907289300947..comments</id><updated>2016-09-21T13:36:13.249-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Sipsey Street Irregulars: Official Correspondence on the Project Gunwalker Scandal.</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='https://billstclair.com/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5499045907289300947/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2011/03/official-correspondence-on-project.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>Dutchman6</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09935420042995679958</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='32' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-0dD3DfcQ3v8/Ub55cPMr2YI/AAAAAAAAXDw/9jlWvTVN5nw/s220/vanderboeghsmuggler.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>5</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6469721934113213648</id><published>2011-11-21T02:59:32.296-06:00</published><updated>2011-11-21T02:59:32.296-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Hey Mike, somewhere along in your busy day could w...</title><content type='html'>Hey Mike, somewhere along in your busy day could we get an update on this link to official correspondence?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5499045907289300947/comments/default/6469721934113213648'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5499045907289300947/comments/default/6469721934113213648'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2011/03/official-correspondence-on-project.html?showComment=1321865972296#c6469721934113213648' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2011/03/official-correspondence-on-project.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-5499045907289300947' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/5499045907289300947' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-286766632"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 21, 2011 at 2:59 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-246301917687341454</id><published>2011-06-12T22:08:33.755-05:00</published><updated>2011-06-12T22:08:33.755-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks Mike,&#xa;&#xa;Have the rest of us done our part?  ...</title><content type='html'>Thanks Mike,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Have the rest of us done our part?  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;ve finally sent a note to Grassley - should have been earlier.  They are holding hearings - let us let them know we&amp;#39;re watching.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;ML27</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5499045907289300947/comments/default/246301917687341454'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5499045907289300947/comments/default/246301917687341454'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2011/03/official-correspondence-on-project.html?showComment=1307934513755#c246301917687341454' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2011/03/official-correspondence-on-project.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-5499045907289300947' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/5499045907289300947' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1063008931"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 12, 2011 at 10:08 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-555364904926928681</id><published>2011-04-01T09:09:02.239-05:00</published><updated>2011-04-01T09:09:02.239-05:00</updated><title type='text'>So the operation that provided a large number of w...</title><content type='html'>So the operation that provided a large number of weapons that were used to commit crimes including the murder of a border agent appears to have been conducted by the ATF, permissioned by the DOJ and possibly involved Secretary of State Clinton. The DOJ actions were authorized by Assistant Attorneys acting under the authority of Attorney General Eric Holder. Where does the buck stop? All the way to the top? The President? This cavalier operation and the crimes and deaths it enabled are in the process of being attributed to those responsible and the names of top administration officials, Holder and Clinton are involved at this point. There is not going to be a hush up concealing the chain of command and the revelation of exactly whose authority was involved. Many thanks to Chuck Grassley and Darryl Issa! Run this to ground and let the American people know. Make government officials who use poor judgement accountable for their actions. This is what Americans deserve.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5499045907289300947/comments/default/555364904926928681'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5499045907289300947/comments/default/555364904926928681'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2011/03/official-correspondence-on-project.html?showComment=1301666942239#c555364904926928681' title=''/><author><name>ConcernedAmerican</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2011/03/official-correspondence-on-project.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-5499045907289300947' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/5499045907289300947' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-285071979"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 1, 2011 at 9:09 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-4327311671705011531</id><published>2011-03-30T19:54:16.487-05:00</published><updated>2011-03-30T19:54:16.487-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Complicity.&#xa;&#xa;Jon&#xa;&#xa;III</title><content type='html'>Complicity.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Jon&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;III</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5499045907289300947/comments/default/4327311671705011531'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5499045907289300947/comments/default/4327311671705011531'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2011/03/official-correspondence-on-project.html?showComment=1301532856487#c4327311671705011531' title=''/><author><name>aughtsix</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2011/03/official-correspondence-on-project.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-5499045907289300947' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/5499045907289300947' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-82333836"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 30, 2011 at 7:54 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-2722032108221783826</id><published>2011-03-30T13:45:23.009-05:00</published><updated>2011-03-30T13:45:23.009-05:00</updated><title type='text'>16 letters yet only two are to congressmen. i find...</title><content type='html'>16 letters yet only two are to congressmen. i find this to be utterly disgusting..&lt;br /&gt;apparently the ATF under the jurisdiction of the DOJ and Holder DO have something to hide.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The question is What</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5499045907289300947/comments/default/2722032108221783826'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5499045907289300947/comments/default/2722032108221783826'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2011/03/official-correspondence-on-project.html?showComment=1301510723009#c2722032108221783826' title=''/><author><name>James</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#t